<article class="env-corollary" id="61B9BC">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/61B9BC">Corollary <span data-tag="61B9BC">7.2.2.27</span>.</a> Let $\calX $ be an $\infty $-topos, $n \geq 2$, and $A$ an abelian group object of $\Disc ( \calX )$. There is a canonical bijection of $\HH ^{n+1}(\calX ; A)$ with the set of equivalence classes of $n$-gerbes on $\calX $ banded by $A$. </p>
